    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34226",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Romeo, Mercutio, Benvolio, with five or six Maskers; Torch-bearers and others.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 32,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 50,
          "end": 72,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34226/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 84,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5333226,
        "end": 5333396,
        "line": 198270,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@34226",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34400",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROMEO.\nWhat, shall this speech be spoke for our excuse?\nOr shall we on without apology?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34400/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34400/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 55,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34400/line-3",
          "start": 56,
          "end": 87,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5333400,
        "end": 5333522,
        "line": 198273,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@34400",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ROMEO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34526",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BENVOLIO.\nThe date is out of such prolixity:\nWe’ll have no Cupid hoodwink’d with a scarf,\nBearing a Tartar’s painted bow of lath,\nScaring the ladies like a crow-keeper;\nNor no without-book prologue, faintly spoke\nAfter the prompter, for our entrance:\nBut let them measure us by what they will,\nWe’ll measure them a measure, and be gone.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34526/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34526/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 44,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34526/line-3",
          "start": 45,
          "end": 89,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34526/line-4",
          "start": 90,
          "end": 129,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34526/line-5",
          "start": 130,
          "end": 168,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34526/line-6",
          "start": 169,
          "end": 212,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34526/line-7",
          "start": 213,
          "end": 250,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34526/line-8",
          "start": 251,
          "end": 293,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34526/line-9",
          "start": 294,
          "end": 336,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5333526,
        "end": 5333927,
        "line": 198279,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@34526",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BENVOLIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34931",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROMEO.\nGive me a torch, I am not for this ambling;\nBeing but heavy I will bear the light.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34931/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34931/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@34931/line-3",
          "start": 51,
          "end": 89,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5333931,
        "end": 5334055,
        "line": 198291,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@34931",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ROMEO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35059",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MERCUTIO.\nNay, gentle Romeo, we must have you dance.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35059/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35059/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5334059,
        "end": 5334141,
        "line": 198297,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@35059",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MERCUTIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35145",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROMEO.\nNot I, believe me, you have dancing shoes,\nWith nimble soles, I have a soul of lead\nSo stakes me to the ground I cannot move.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35145/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35145/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35145/line-3",
          "start": 50,
          "end": 90,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35145/line-4",
          "start": 91,
          "end": 132,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5334145,
        "end": 5334317,
        "line": 198302,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@35145",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ROMEO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35321",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MERCUTIO.\nYou are a lover, borrow Cupid’s wings,\nAnd soar with them above a common bound.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35321/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35321/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 48,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35321/line-3",
          "start": 49,
          "end": 89,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5334321,
        "end": 5334445,
        "line": 198309,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@35321",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MERCUTIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35449",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROMEO.\nI am too sore enpierced with his shaft\nTo soar with his light feathers, and so bound,\nI cannot bound a pitch above dull woe.\nUnder love’s heavy burden do I sink.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35449/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35449/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 45,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35449/line-3",
          "start": 46,
          "end": 92,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35449/line-4",
          "start": 93,
          "end": 131,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35449/line-5",
          "start": 132,
          "end": 168,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5334449,
        "end": 5334662,
        "line": 198315,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@35449",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ROMEO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35666",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MERCUTIO.\nAnd, to sink in it, should you burden love;\nToo great oppression for a tender thing.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35666/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35666/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35666/line-3",
          "start": 54,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5334666,
        "end": 5334795,
        "line": 198323,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@35666",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MERCUTIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35799",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROMEO.\nIs love a tender thing? It is too rough,\nToo rude, too boisterous; and it pricks like thorn.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35799/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35799/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 47,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35799/line-3",
          "start": 48,
          "end": 99,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5334799,
        "end": 5334933,
        "line": 198329,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@35799",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ROMEO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35937",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MERCUTIO.\nIf love be rough with you, be rough with love;\nPrick love for pricking, and you beat love down.\nGive me a case to put my visage in: [Putting on a mask.]\nA visor for a visor. What care I\nWhat curious eye doth quote deformities?\nHere are the beetle-brows shall blush for me.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 143,
          "end": 161
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35937/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35937/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 56,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35937/line-3",
          "start": 57,
          "end": 105,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35937/line-4",
          "start": 106,
          "end": 162,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35937/line-5",
          "start": 163,
          "end": 195,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35937/line-6",
          "start": 196,
          "end": 236,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@35937/line-7",
          "start": 237,
          "end": 282,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5334937,
        "end": 5335281,
        "line": 198335,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@35937",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MERCUTIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36285",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BENVOLIO.\nCome, knock and enter; and no sooner in\nBut every man betake him to his legs.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36285/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36285/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36285/line-3",
          "start": 50,
          "end": 87,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5335285,
        "end": 5335407,
        "line": 198345,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@36285",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BENVOLIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36411",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROMEO.\nA torch for me: let wantons, light of heart,\nTickle the senseless rushes with their heels;\nFor I am proverb’d with a grandsire phrase,\nI’ll be a candle-holder and look on,\nThe game was ne’er so fair, and I am done.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36411/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36411/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36411/line-3",
          "start": 52,
          "end": 97,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36411/line-4",
          "start": 98,
          "end": 141,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36411/line-5",
          "start": 142,
          "end": 178,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36411/line-6",
          "start": 179,
          "end": 221,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5335411,
        "end": 5335682,
        "line": 198351,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@36411",
        "anchor": "sceneI_30.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ROMEO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneI_30.4/p@36686",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MERCUTIO.\nTut, dun’s the mouse, the constable’s own word:\nIf thou art dun, we’ll draw thee from the mire\nOr save your reverence love, wherein thou stickest\nUp to the ears. Come, we burn daylight, ho.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
