      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MERCUTIO.\nI mean sir, in delay\nWe waste our lights in vain, light lights by day.\nTake our good meaning, for our judgment sits\nFive times in that ere once in our five wits.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
